msgstr "በብዙ ያልተሳኩ የመግባት ሙከራዎች ምክንያት መለያህ ተቆልፏል። እባክዎ ቆይተው እንደገና ይሞክሩ።"

#: capcomposer/build/lib/capcomposer/config/templates/axes/lockout.html:17
#: capcomposer/src/capcomposer/config/templates/axes/lockout.html:17
